  "description": "Tikka N Kabab is a Pakistani and Indian restaurant in far North Dallas on McCallum Blvd, about 2 miles from UT Dallas. Known for Chicken 65, Butter Chicken, Chicken Tikka Masala, Beef Nihari, BBQ/grill and kababs, biryani and samosas, at friendly prices (samosas $3.99, curries $12.99). Open every day 11 AM to 9:30 PM. Order online at tikkankababtx.com or call (469) 857-3000.",
